# Appendix A. 참고 구현 예시

## A-1. `invert(SetCellsOp)` 정확한 구현

### Operation 타입

```ts
export type CellValue = string | null;

export type SetCellsOp = {
  kind: "setCells";
  cells: Array<{
    row: number;
    col: number;
    prev: CellValue;
    next: CellValue;
  }>;
};
```

---

### invert 구현

```ts
export function invertSetCellsOp(op: SetCellsOp): SetCellsOp {
  return {
    kind: "setCells",
    cells: op.cells.map(cell => ({
      row: cell.row,
      col: cell.col,
      prev: cell.next,
      next: cell.prev,
    })),
  };
}
```

---

### 적용 함수 (공통)

```ts
export function applySetCellsOp(
  doc: DutyDoc,
  op: SetCellsOp,
): DutyDoc {
  for (const { row, col, next } of op.cells) {
    doc.rows[row].cells[col] = next;
  }
  return doc;
}
```

> ✔ undo: `invertSetCellsOp(op)`
> ✔ redo: `op` 그대로 재적용
> ✔ snapshot 불필요

---

## A-2. Selection 이동 알고리즘

### 타입

```ts
export type CellPos = { row: number; col: number };

export type Selection =
  | { type: "single"; anchor: CellPos }
  | { type: "range"; from: CellPos; to: CellPos };

export type Direction = "up" | "down" | "left" | "right";
```

---

### 단일 셀 이동 계산

```ts
function moveCell(
  pos: CellPos,
  dir: Direction,
  rowCount: number,
  colCount: number,
): CellPos {
  let { row, col } = pos;

  switch (dir) {
    case "right":
      col++;
      if (col >= colCount) {
        row++;
        col = 0;
      }
      break;

    case "left":
      col--;
      if (col < 0) {
        row--;
        col = colCount - 1;
      }
      break;

    case "down":
      row++;
      break;

    case "up":
      row--;
      break;
  }

  if (row < 0 || row >= rowCount) return pos;
  if (col < 0 || col >= colCount) return pos;

  return { row, col };
}
```

---

### Selection 이동 (extend 포함)

```ts
export function moveSelection(
  selection: Selection | null,
  dir: Direction,
  extend: boolean,
  rowCount: number,
  colCount: number,
): Selection | null {
  if (!selection) return null;

  if (selection.type === "single") {
    const next = moveCell(
      selection.anchor,
      dir,
      rowCount,
      colCount,
    );

    if (extend) {
      return {
        type: "range",
        from: selection.anchor,
        to: next,
      };
    }

    return {
      type: "single",
      anchor: next,
    };
  }

  // range selection
  const nextTo = moveCell(
    selection.to,
    dir,
    rowCount,
    colCount,
  );

  return {
    type: "range",
    from: selection.from,
    to: nextTo,
  };
}
```

> ✔ selection 이동은 history ❌
> ✔ range 확장은 Shift 키로만 발생
> ✔ bounds 초과 시 이동 무시

---

## A-3. Clipboard Normalize 로직

### ClipboardPayload

```ts
export type ClipboardPayload = {
  width: number;
  height: number;
  cells: CellValue[][];
};
```

---

### Selection → 정규화된 직사각형

```ts
function normalizeRange(sel: Selection): {
  top: number;
  left: number;
  bottom: number;
  right: number;
} {
  if (sel.type === "single") {
    const { row, col } = sel.anchor;
    return { top: row, bottom: row, left: col, right: col };
  }

  return {
    top: Math.min(sel.from.row, sel.to.row),
    bottom: Math.max(sel.from.row, sel.to.row),
    left: Math.min(sel.from.col, sel.to.col),
    right: Math.max(sel.from.col, sel.to.col),
  };
}
```

---

### Copy 구현

```ts
export function copySelection(
  doc: DutyDoc,
  selection: Selection | null,
): ClipboardPayload | null {
  if (!selection) return null;

  const { top, left, bottom, right } =
    normalizeRange(selection);

  const height = bottom - top + 1;
  const width = right - left + 1;

  const cells: CellValue[][] = [];

  for (let r = 0; r < height; r++) {
    const row: CellValue[] = [];
    for (let c = 0; c < width; c++) {
      row.push(
        doc.rows[top + r]?.cells[left + c] ?? null,
      );
    }
    cells.push(row);
  }

  return { width, height, cells };
}
```

---

### Paste → SetCellsOp 생성

```ts
export function pastePayload(
  payload: ClipboardPayload,
  selection: Selection,
  doc: DutyDoc,
): SetCellsOp {
  const anchor =
    selection.type === "single"
      ? selection.anchor
      : normalizeRange(selection);

  const startRow =
    "row" in anchor ? anchor.row : anchor.top;
  const startCol =
    "col" in anchor ? anchor.col : anchor.left;

  const cells: SetCellsOp["cells"] = [];

  for (let r = 0; r < payload.height; r++) {
    for (let c = 0; c < payload.width; c++) {
      const row = startRow + r;
      const col = startCol + c;

      if (
        row >= doc.rows.length ||
        col >= doc.columns.length
      ) {
        continue; // 자동 자르기
      }

      const prev = doc.rows[row].cells[col];
      const next = payload.cells[r][c];

      if (prev !== next) {
        cells.push({ row, col, prev, next });
      }
    }
  }

  return {
    kind: "setCells",
    cells,
  };
}
```

> ✔ paste 결과는 항상 **SetCellsOp 1개**
> ✔ 실패 없음
> ✔ 범위 초과 자동 절단
> ✔ prev === next 인 셀은 제외 (history 최적화)

---

## Appendix 요약

- **invert(SetCellsOp)**
  → `prev ↔ next` swap만으로 완전한 역연산

- **Selection 이동**
  → 계산 전용, history 영향 없음

- **Clipboard**
  → normalize → 2D payload → 단일 SetCellsOp

이 Appendix를 그대로 문서 하단에 붙이면
**다른 에이전트가 “의도 오해 없이” 바로 구현 가능한 수준**입니다.
